  "project_description": "This module will help you to set a field required only in a specific form mode.\n\nYou can keep the field optional for some form modes while required for others.\n\nThis module's functionality is tested and supports these entities (node, user, taxonamy_term).\n\n How to use the module: \n\n- After enabling the module, go to any field you need to make it required and keep it not-required from the settings.\n\n- Go to the form mode now, and in the field settings, you will be able to set this field required.\n\n This module is working great with other form mode modules like:\n\n form_mode_manager module.",
